Package: megacmd-applet
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, gum, procps, xdg-utils, libglib2.0-bin
Recommends: megacmd
Description: MEGA sync folders, backups, storage and transfers in the panel
 MEGA in the desktop's panel, driven by MEGAcmd: sync folders, backups,
 storage and transfers, with a notification once per problem.
 .
 This package holds the shared core and the guided dialogs; install the one
 for your desktop: megacmd-applet-kde, megacmd-applet-gnome or
 megacmd-applet-cosmic. MEGAcmd comes from MEGA's own repository.

Package: megacmd-applet-kde
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, megacmd-applet (= ${source:Version}), plasma-workspace
Description: MEGAcmd applet for the KDE Plasma panel
 MEGA in the desktop's panel, driven by MEGAcmd: sync folders, backups,
 storage and transfers, with a notification once per problem.
 .
 This package holds the Plasma 6 panel widget.

Package: megacmd-applet-gnome
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, megacmd-applet (= ${source:Version}), gnome-shell (>= 48)
Description: MEGAcmd applet for the GNOME Shell top bar
 MEGA in the desktop's panel, driven by MEGAcmd: sync folders, backups,
 storage and transfers, with a notification once per problem.
 .
 This package holds the GNOME Shell extension; turn it on in the Extensions
 app.

Package: megacmd-applet-cosmic
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, megacmd-applet (= ${source:Version})
Recommends: cosmic-panel
Description: MEGAcmd applet for the COSMIC panel
 MEGA in the desktop's panel, driven by MEGAcmd: sync folders, backups,
 storage and transfers, with a notification once per problem.
 .
 This package holds the COSMIC panel applet; add it in Settings, Desktop,
 Panel, Applets.
